sequenceDiagram

box MGM onboarding
Actor NETWORK_OPERATOR as Network Operator
participant MGM as MGM Cluster
%%participant CA as Certification Authority <br/> +OSCP   
end

NETWORK_OPERATOR->>NETWORK_OPERATOR: Create an MGM GroupPolicy.json
NETWORK_OPERATOR->>NETWORK_OPERATOR: Package MGM GroupPolicy.json file<br/> into an MGM CPI

NETWORK_OPERATOR->>+MGM: Upload the CPI to your cluster
MGM-->>-NETWORK_OPERATOR: return CPI ID

NETWORK_OPERATOR->>+MGM: CPI get status API
MGM-->>-NETWORK_OPERATOR: cpiFileChecksum

NETWORK_OPERATOR->>+MGM: Create a virtual node in your cluster for the MGM(cpiFileChecksum, x500Name)
MGM-->>-NETWORK_OPERATOR: return: holding identity ID

NETWORK_OPERATOR->>+MGM: Assign required HSMs for the MGM 
MGM-->>-NETWORK_OPERATOR: SESSION KEY ID

NETWORK_OPERATOR->>+MGM: Create required keys, and optionally import required certificates
MGM-->>-NETWORK_OPERATOR: ECDH KEY ID

NETWORK_OPERATOR->>+MGM: Use the register endpoint to finalise the MGM setup so that it is ready to accept members
MGM-->>-NETWORK_OPERATOR:  

NETWORK_OPERATOR->>+NETWORK_OPERATOR: Build registration context

NETWORK_OPERATOR->>+MGM: Register MGM membership/$MGM_HOLDING_ID(action=requestJoin, REGISTRATION_CONTEXT)
MGM-->>-NETWORK_OPERATOR: return SUBMITTED

NETWORK_OPERATOR->>+MGM: Configure P2P TLS cert(SESSION KEY ID)
MGM-->>-NETWORK_OPERATOR: return


NETWORK_OPERATOR->>+MGM: export group policy for group 
MGM-->>-NETWORK_OPERATOR: return GroupPolicy.json
